@baseUrl = http://localhost:5049
@companyId = REPLACE_WITH_COMPANY_ID
@jobId = REPLACE_WITH_JOB_ID

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### OpenAPI (Development)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Create company: copy response id into companyId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "JobTot Technology",
  "description": "Software company"
}

### Companies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies?page=1&pageSize=20

### Create job: copy response id into jobId; choose a future expiresAt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "job": {
    "title": "ASP.NET Core Developer",
    "description": "Build recruitment APIs with C#, EF Core and SQL Server.",
    "location": "Hanoi",
    "salaryMin": 20000000,
    "salaryMax": 40000000,
    "expiresAt": "2030-12-31T23:59:59+07:00"
  }
}

### Search open jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?keyword=Developer&location=Hanoi&page=1&pageSize=20

### Job details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}

### Update job
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior ASP.NET Core Developer",
  "description": "Build and maintain recruitment APIs.",
  "location": "Hanoi",
  "salaryMin": 30000000,
  "salaryMax": 50000000,
  "expiresAt": "2030-12-31T23:59:59+07:00"
}

### Close job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobId}}/close

### Include closed and expired jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?includeClosed=true

### Invalid pagination: expect 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?page=0&pageSize=101
